{
  "id": 8859738603719,
  "title": "Personalized Colorful Celtic Yggdrasil Tree Quilt Sets - Vintage",
  "handle": "personalized-colorful-celtic-yggdrasil-tree-quilt-sets-vintage",
  "body_html": "<p>Discover the Jeminise Tree of Life Quilt Set, a perfect blend of symbolic design and everyday comfort. This quilt set features an amazing Yggdrasil design, symbolizing resilience and interconnectedness, making it a thoughtful and practical gift for loved ones or a meaningful addition to your home.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Design:</strong> Adorned with the Yggdrasil Tree of Life, representing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Functional as a bedding set, decorative throw, or a cozy wrap for relaxing on the sofa, perfect for both indoor and outdoor use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for housewarmings, weddings, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, or any special occasion for family and friends.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, dries quickly, and maintains its fluffiness; best washed in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes with 1 Quilt, with an optional Pillowcase.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Minimalist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches), Twin(68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
